sequenceDiagram
  participant Scheduler
  participant Lifecycle
  participant Attestor
  participant Network
  participant Runner
  participant Observability
  Scheduler->>Lifecycle: signed job intent
  Lifecycle->>Lifecycle: allocate encrypted microVM
  Lifecycle->>Attestor: verify image/host/config
  Attestor-->>Lifecycle: measurements
  Lifecycle->>Network: short target firewall lease
  Lifecycle->>Runner: assign one job
  Runner->>Observability: telemetry and artifacts
  Runner-->>Lifecycle: complete or stop
  Lifecycle->>Network: revoke all leases
  Lifecycle->>Observability: final ledger
  Observability-->>Lifecycle: evidence seal/timeout
  Lifecycle->>Lifecycle: destroy VM, volume and key
  Lifecycle->>Observability: residual result
